<title>USA: Shoe Carnival Inc Q1 earnings rise.</title>
<headline>Shoe Carnival Inc Q1 earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.14		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			  1,818			921</p>
<p> Revs			59,328		   58,208</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,054		   13,019</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 results include a charge of about $650,000 for costs associated with the May 1997 retirement of David Russell, former vice chairman, president and chief executive. Russell will continue to serve on Shoe Carnival's board and will be retained on a consulting basis for three years.</p>
</text>
